b:["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-6 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-sm","children":"lahore's current weather in June 2026 shows a temperature of 38°C, feeling like 37°C with clear sky. Humidity levels are at 23%, with winds moving at 12 km/h. For residents and visitors in lahore, these conditions are quite hot — staying hydrated and limiting midday sun exposure is strongly advised. lahore's climate (موسم) during June follows the pattern of the Upper Indus Plain — the city's position in the Punjab heartland means temperatures can vary significantly between morning and afternoon. Locals heading to Anarkali Bazaar, Model Town, or DHA are advised to check the hourly forecast above for the best time to travel. The weather data on this page is sourced live from OpenWeatherMap and updates every hour."}]
