26:T46f,lahore — known locally as لاہور — is Lahore is the capital and largest city of the Pakistani province of Punjab. It is the second-largest city in Pakistan, after Karachi, and 27th largest in the world, with a population of over 14 million. Lahore is one of Pakistan's major industrial, educational and economic hubs. It has been the historic capital and cultural centre of the wider Punjab region, and is one of Pakistan's most socially liberal, progressive, and cosmopolitan cities.. As of June 2026, the city serves as the capital of punjab and remains a cornerstone of pakistan's cultural, economic, and intellectual identity. Home to world-class universities, centuries-old mosques, and a food scene celebrated across South Asia, lahore offers visitors and residents an experience unlike any other city on the subcontinent. This page provides live, real-time information for lahore including current weather conditions, today's prayer times (اوقات نماز), gold and currency rates, breaking news, upcoming events, and much more — all updated continuously to serve the people of lahore and those planning to visit.1a:["$","section",null,{"id":"glance","className":"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm p-6","children":[["$","h2",null,{"style":{"fontFamily":"Playfair Display, serif"},"className":"text-2xl font-bold text-[#01411C] mb-4","children":["📋 ","lahore"," at a Glance — ",2026]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-6","children":[["$","div","Population",{"className":"bg-[#F5F3EE] rounded-xl p-4","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"text-xs text-gray-500","children":"Population"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-[#01411C] mt-1","children":"13M+"}]]}],["$","div","Area",{"className":"bg-[#F5F3EE] rounded-xl p-4","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"text-xs text-gray-500","children":"Area"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-[#01411C] mt-1","children":"1,772 km²"}]]}],["$","div","Elevation",{"className":"